  "title": {
   "en": "Mountain Spirit: The Unsettling Tales"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "zh": "山傀：山神诡录"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Zhou Hao is a timid guy with a special constitution that always attracts strange encounters. Too scared to return alone to his eerie hometown for his uncle's funeral, he begs his best buddy to go with him, bringing their dog along for moral support. Thinking they'd simply boost his courage, they end up stumbling upon something truly uncanny...",
   "zh": "体质特殊总能撞见怪事的胆小鬼周昊，不敢独自回到怪异的乡下参加大伯的葬礼，死皮赖脸叫上了好兄弟带着狗一起陪他，原以为是壮胆的作用，结果真遇上了诡事……"
  },
